{
 "regions": {
  "r3": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "तदुदीर्णं महत् सैन्यं त्रैलोक्यस्यापि संजय।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "भयमुत्पादयेत् तीव्रं पाण्डवानां महात्मनाम्॥११॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r4": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "को हि दुर्योधने सैन्ये पुमानासीन्महारथः।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "यं प्राप्य समरे वीरा न त्रस्यन्ति महाभये॥१२॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r5": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Verily, O Sanjaya, the innumerable and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "excellent army of the high-souled sons of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Pandu, can strike the worlds with keenest",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "apprehension. In this terrific battle, was any",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "great car-warrior in the troop of Duryodhana",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "who was feerless?",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r6": {
   "type": "speaker",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "संजय उवाच",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r7": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "देवव्रते तु निहते कुरूणामृषभे तदा।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "किमकार्षुर्नृपतयस्तन्ममाचक्ष्व संजय॥१३॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r8": {
   "type": "speaker",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Sanjaya said",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r9": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Therefore, O Sanjaya, recount to me what",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "the kings did, when Devarata, the foremost of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "the Kurus, had been slain.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r10": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "शृणु राजन्नेकमना वचनं ब्रुवतो मम।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "यत् ते पुत्रास्तदाऽकार्षुर्हते देवव्रते मृधे॥१४॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r11": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Hear, O monarch, with singleness of mind,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "the words, falling from my lips, regarding what",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "your sons did when Devavrata had fallen.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r12": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "निहते तु तदा भीष्मे राजन् सत्यपराक्रमे।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "तावकाः पाण्डवेयाश्च प्राध्यायन्त पृथक् पृथक्॥१५॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r13": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "O monarch, when Bhishma of invincible",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "prowess had been slain, your own warriors and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "also those of the Pandava host, began to think",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "of the duties of the Kshatriya sect; and,",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r14": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "विस्मिताश्च प्रहृष्टाश्च क्षत्रधर्मं निशम्य ते।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "स्वधर्मं निन्दमानास्ते प्रणिपत्य महात्मने॥१६॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r15": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "शयनं कल्पयामासुर्भीष्मायामितकर्मणे।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "सोपधानं नरव्याघ्र शरैः संनतपर्वभिः॥१७॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r16": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "O lord of men, at the thought, they",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "wondered and were delighted; and in",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "obedience to their sectarian duties, they bowed",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "down to the illustrious Bhishma. Then those",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "foremost of men prepared for Bhishma of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "infinite energy a bed furnished with a pillow,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "made of close-knotted arrows.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r17": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "विधाय रक्षां भीष्माय समाभाष्य परस्परम्।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "अनुमान्य च गाङ्गेयं कृत्वा चापि प्रदक्षिणम्॥१८॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r18": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "क्रोधसंरक्तनयनाः समवेक्ष्य परस्परम्।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "पुनर्युद्धाय निर्जग्मुः क्षत्रियाः कालचोदिताः॥१९॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r19": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Having arranged for Bhishma’s safety and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "having greeted one another, and with the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "permission of the son of Ganga and having",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "circumambulated him and looking at each",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "other with eyes coppery with anger, those",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Kshatriyas, goaded by Destiny, again issued",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "forth for fighting with one another.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r20": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "ततस्तूर्यनिनादैश्च भेरीणां निनदेन च।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "तावकानामनीकानि परेषां च विनिर्ययुः॥२०॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r21": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Then to the voice of the trumpets and to the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "roar of the drums, the army of your sons and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "that of their adversaries, formed in battle-array.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r22": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "व्यावृत्तेऽह्नि राजेन्द्र पतिते जाह्नवीसुते।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "अमर्षवशमापन्नाः कालोपहतचेतसः॥२१॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": true,
   "note": "The first compound in line 1 is difficult to read."
  },
  "r23": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "अनादृत्य वचः पथ्यं गाङ्गेयस्य महात्मनः।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "निर्ययुर्भरतश्रेष्ठाः शस्त्राण्यादाय सत्वराः॥२२॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r24": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "When, O greatest of kings, the son of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Janhavi (Bhishma) had fallen and when the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "greater part of the day had worn out, these",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "foremost of the Bharata race, overpowered by",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "the influence of their wrath, and having their",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "reasons bewildered through fate and neglecting",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "the salutary counsel of the illustrious son of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "Ganga, came out in haste grasping their",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "weapons.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r25": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "मोहात् तव सपुत्रस्य वधाच्छान्तनवस्य च।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "कौरव्या मृत्युसाद्भूताः सहिताः सर्वराजभिः॥२३॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r26": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Owing to your own foolishness and that of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "your sons and owing to the death of the son of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Shantanu, the descendants of the Kuru race",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "together with all the (assembled) kings,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "appeared to be summoned by the God of death.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r27": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "अजावय इवागोपा वने श्वापदसंकुले।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "भृशमुद्विग्नमनसो हीना देवव्रतेन ते॥२४॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r28": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Like a herd of goats without a herdsman in",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "wood infested with beasts of prey, they were",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "exceedingly oppressed with fear, being",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "deprived of Devavrata.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r29": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "पतिते भरतश्रेष्ठे बभूव कुरुवाहिनी।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "द्यौरिवापेतनक्षत्रा हीनं खमिव वायुना॥२५॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r1": {
   "type": "page_number",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "2",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r2": {
   "type": "running_header",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "MAHĀBHĀRATA",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  }
 },
